  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"I made these dark maps of the UNC Chapel Hill campus in frustration over coronoavirus spread on college campuses both locally &amp; nationally soon after classes began in Fall 2020. On the map, 1112 yellow dots are scattered on the campus walking paths, representing what the density of cases at UNC Chapel Hill would have looked like if every person on campus with COVID-19 at that point in time were walking around central campus at the same time" -- Artist's statement.</subfield>
  </datafield>
